{"availability":"available","full":"ranaumarbilal31/Leaflens","name":"Leaflens","description":"Plant leaf image classifier with a React interface, FastAPI/PyTorch inference, 38 leaf categories, and a free Hugging Face demo.","category":"Education","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-30T08:42:40Z","updated":"2026-10-02T10:41:05Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ranaumarbilal31-leaflens.hf.space/","topics":["computer-vision","deep-learning","fastapi","gradio","huggingface-spaces","image-classification","plant-disease-detection","plant-health","pytorch","react","resnet","typescript","zerogpu"],"demo":"https://ranaumarbilal31-leaflens.hf.space/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.306Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.306Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.306Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.306Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Upload a leaf photo, get a possible plant-health match in seconds.","A leaf-photo checker with a React + TypeScript interface and a FastAPI / PyTorch inference service.","LeafLens classifies a single leaf photo into one of 38 categories covering 14 plants. Each category is a plant paired with either a disease/condition or a healthy label. It is built around an existing ResNet9 image-classification checkpoint; no new training happens in this project. The work here is the application around the model: validated uploads, fixed-size preprocessing, accessible UI states, and inference with bounded concurrency."],"features":["Simple flow: upload one JPEG or PNG and get the top category with its softmax score.","Careful preprocessing: file validation, EXIF orientation correction, RGB conversion, resize to 256 × 256, and transparent backgrounds composited onto white.","Privacy-minded: photos are processed in memory and never saved or used for training.","Two runtimes: a local CPU build (FastAPI) and a hosted build on Hugging Face ZeroGPU (Gradio adapter).","Health endpoint: /api/health is available in both modes."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ranaumarbilal31/Leaflens/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"8036714f847d3b2301097d0bae7b64a5fe43e40caf6469e605b46e35e4611e34","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.426Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.426Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Upload a leaf photo, get a possible plant-health match in seconds.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ranaumarbilal31/Leaflens/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"8036714f847d3b2301097d0bae7b64a5fe43e40caf6469e605b46e35e4611e34","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ranaumarbilal31/Leaflens/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.426Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T10:41:05Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ranaumarbilal31/Leaflens/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T22:34:40.426Z","hash":"8036714f847d3b2301097d0bae7b64a5fe43e40caf6469e605b46e35e4611e34","originalBytes":7556,"storedBytes":7556,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["python","leaflens","hosted","build","local","notebook","run","tests","adapter","api","cpu","docker","face","fastapi","hugging","install","interface","leaf","model","npm","resnet9","space","app","bash","built","category","demo","health","license","photos","playwright","react","test","uses","workflows","zerogpu","checkpoint","endpoint","get","github","gradio","live","locally","notices.md","party","pip","plant","preprocessing","project","pytest","pytorch","queue","reference","shared","third","training","typescript","used","web","accuracy","api.main","application","architecture","around","assets","atharva","backgrounds","browser","check","chromium","data","disease","dockerfile","each","expect","field","file","home","how","independently","inference","ingle","leaves","memory","mit","model.","node.js","one","orientatio